<details id="image-layout-guide" class="image-layout-guide">
  <summary>Composition sketch</summary>
  <p class="image-help">Place named zones to show the desired composition. This sketch is a visual guide; the model may change the placement, the shapes and the names.</p>
  <div class="layout-guide-actions">
    <button id="image-layout-format" class="quiet-button" type="button">Use the current format</button>
    <button id="image-layout-new" class="quiet-button" type="button">New sketch</button>
    <label class="quiet-button layout-guide-import" for="image-layout-file">Reopen a JSON project<input id="image-layout-file" type="file" accept=".json,application/json"></label>
  </div>
  <p id="image-layout-status" class="image-help" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <p id="image-layout-error" class="layout-guide-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
  <div id="image-layout-workspace" hidden>
    <p id="image-layout-format-label" class="image-help"></p>
    <div class="layout-guide-preview"><canvas id="image-layout-canvas" tabindex="0" aria-label="Composition sketch. Click to place the selected zone or use the arrow keys."></canvas></div>
    <p class="image-help">Click to place the zone’s top-left corner. The arrow keys move the zone by 0.1%; Shift + arrow, by 1%.</p>
    <div class="layout-guide-actions"><label for="image-layout-zone">Zone to edit</label><button id="image-layout-add" class="quiet-button" type="button">Add a zone</button></div>
    <select id="image-layout-zone" aria-label="Zone to edit"></select>
    <fieldset id="image-layout-fields" disabled>
      <legend>Name and placement</legend>
      <label for="image-layout-name">Zone name<input id="image-layout-name" type="text" maxlength="160" placeholder="Main subject, room, workshop…"></label>
      <div class="layout-guide-grid">
        <label for="image-layout-x">Horizontal position (%)<input id="image-layout-x" type="number" min="0" max="99" step="0.01"></label>
        <label for="image-layout-y">Vertical position (%)<input id="image-layout-y" type="number" min="0" max="99" step="0.01"></label>
        <label for="image-layout-width">Width (%)<input id="image-layout-width" type="number" min="1" max="100" step="0.01"></label>
        <label for="image-layout-height">Height (%)<input id="image-layout-height" type="number" min="1" max="100" step="0.01"></label>
      </div>
      <label for="image-layout-color">Zone color<input id="image-layout-color" type="color" value="#c5d9cf"></label>
      <button id="image-layout-delete" class="quiet-button" type="button">Delete this zone</button>
    </fieldset>
    <div class="layout-guide-actions">
      <button id="image-layout-attach" class="reference-button" type="button">Attach the sketch</button>
      <button id="image-layout-remove-reference" class="quiet-button" type="button" hidden>Remove the attached sketch</button>
      <button id="image-layout-png" class="quiet-button" type="button">Download the PNG</button>
      <button id="image-layout-json" class="quiet-button" type="button">Save the JSON project</button>
    </div>
    <p class="image-help">The sketch takes one of the two available references, parent included. Attaching it prepares the request; then use the create button. The JSON project keeps the zones so you can edit them offline.</p>
  </div>
</details>
